From 42384ed26b6f51d98620bde02e07da240e8ba090 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 17:04:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(wallet): expose paymentEnvironment in /api/financial
 config response
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

O frontend (PrizeWallet.tsx) já lia data?.config.paymentEnvironment para
decidir se mostra o aviso "Ambiente Asaas Sandbox" e o lembrete de usar
chave PIX de homologação, mas o backend nunca populava esse campo no
config retornado -- o aviso nunca aparecia porque o valor sempre chegava
undefined. isStrictAsaasSandbox() já existia e já era usada para outra
decisão (linha 144); só faltava expor o resultado dela no payload do
config, como o teste api/__tests__/withdrawal-provider-rejection-recovery.test.ts
já cobrava.
---
 api/_handlers/financial.ts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/api/_handlers/financial.ts b/api/_handlers/financial.ts
index 9523086..35adfdb 100644
--- a/api/_handlers/financial.ts
+++ b/api/_handlers/financial.ts
@@ -279,6 +279,7 @@ export default async function handler(req: VercelRequest, res: VercelResponse) {
           minWithdrawalAmount: money(config.minWithdrawalAmount),
           maxDailyWithdrawalAmount: money(config.maxDailyWithdrawalAmount),
           identityCheckEnabled: ENFORCE_IDENTITY_FOR_WITHDRAWAL,
+          paymentEnvironment: isStrictAsaasSandbox() ? 'sandbox' : 'production',
         },
         identity: identityPayload(identity),
         cashSource: 'official_prizes_only',
-- 
